/*--------------------------------*- Choupo -*--------------------------------*\
  species/HMalic.dat -- ONE model species, ONE typed file: the singly charged anion of malic acid.

  NO `aqueousThermo` ON PURPOSE.  The ionisation (pK, dH) of malic acid is measured in
  Eden & Bates, J. Res. Natl. Bur. Stand. 62 (1959) 161, Table 5, p. 169, and is in chemistry/ -- so
  the SPECIATION (pH, distribution) is complete.  No work in hand prints a formation enthalpy or
  entropy of this aqueous ion, so a balance that needs its enthalpy REFUSES BY NAME instead of
  borrowing a value.
\*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
recordType modelSpecies;
schemaVersion 1;

name    HMalic;
formula     "HC4H4O5-";
charge  -1;
MW { value 133.079; unit g/mol;}
